WEBVTT

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:30.727
Waxaan rumeysanahay.

00:10:30.727 --> 00:10:34.185
In isku daygaaga jaceyl iyo xanaanad .

00:10:34.185 --> 00:10:37.589
ay badbaadin kartaa nolosha Joseph kale (Joseph waa magaca ninka ka sheekeynaya sheekada qabsatay)

00:10:37.589 --> 00:10:43.031
ayna badali karto kumanaan Joseph oo kale.

00:10:43.031 --> 00:10:47.033
Yaa leh rajo ah in uu badbaado.

00:10:47.033 --> 00:10:48.340
Waad mahadsan tihiin.

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:57.438
(Sabcis)